# Anti-over-engineering

Only change what was asked. Simplest solution first. When unsure, ask.

Do not modify unrequested code, add abstractions without a concrete need, add dependencies you can avoid,
rewrite whole files for small changes, or add error handling for impossible scenarios.

Before delivering: confirm you only changed requested code, check for a simpler approach,
and confirm no unrequested files were touched.
